e commander, Suito Kusanagi. Area 262 has the answers, but the truth comes with a price the young pilot may not be ready to pay.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Clone","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Sky Crawlers","english":"The Sky Crawlers","native":"スカイ・クロラ","romaji":"Sky Crawlers","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"スカイ・クロラ The Sky Crawlers"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"空中杀手"}]},"trailer":{"id":"O21bxZrHvY8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/O21bxZrHvY8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}